    "# DADA-2000 original — Phase 1 / **Gate D0**\n",
    "\n",
    "Runbook: `core/docs/DADA_ORIGIN_PHASE1.md` · Plan: `.project/plans/katvad-dada-original-phase1-gate-d0.md`\n",
    "\n",
    "**GPU runtime.** Nothing in `core/` changes. One number comes out: the frame linear probe `auc_macro`.\n",
    "PASS ≥ 0.60 · marginal 0.55–0.60 · **STOP < 0.55**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
